# Testing

Non-trivial `lib/` logic (filters, RBAC, title rules) gets **one** test file beside it. Pattern: `lib/rbac.ts` + `lib/rbac.test.ts`. Run with `pnpm test`.

No test frameworks beyond what the repo already uses. No fixture factories, MSW, or screen snapshot tests this phase.

Do not put tests under `app/`. Trivial one-liners need no test. UI screens need no required test file unless a helper was extracted.

Unknown role must throw — do not add a test that swallows it.

When extending `Conversation` / `Person`, update RBAC tests that construct those objects in the same change (`unreadCount`, `isOnline`, etc.).
